steel.pageone.name=Steel is made via putting 2 netherite scrap, and 4 iron ingots in a crafting table
steel.pagetwo.name=Steel ingots are used to make several bomb types, such as missiles. Get a ton of it as you'll likely need a lot of it, for instance the ballistic missiles need steel blocks to be made
