lead.title.name=Lead Ore
lead.text.name=Lead ore is an ore that can be found underground, it requires iron+ to be broken, its main use is in making the Mechanical Builder, the main crafting station for the tech side of BoG, it can be found roughly like iron, though not as common.

radiation.title.name=Radiation
radiation.labal.one.name=Radiation basics
radiation.text.one.name=Radiation is a major factor in this addon, most dangerous parts of playing this come from radiation! Most blocks related to nuclear bombs (and anything else nuclear) release at least an amount of radiation that will affect the player, too much and you'll get sick.
radiation.label.two.name=Radiation sickness
radiation.text.two.name=Radiation sickness happens when you reach a dose of 10 radiation or more, going up from there the effects will get worse with the heigher it gets till once beyond around 150, it will just start outright killing you, the only ways to avoid or get rid of radiation sickness are a gasmask, and rotten soup.
radiation.label.three.name=Geiger counter
radiation.text.three.name=The Geiger counter is an item that can be used to detect radiation in an area and how much you have, it is the main way to do it and is a must have for anyone working with radiation in this addon.

atomic.credits.title.name=Credits
atomic.credits.text.name=Sound + shockwave system by MapleStar, Bits for ticking system inspired by code by Coolbep and gameza_src's chunk loader systems, Concept for chunk filling system by Conmaster, Updated textures for several items by Clean38 (Massive thank you on this one), new plane model and fat man (gun) by sh8lt8yb8lt8y, Thank you to people from the BOA discord for all their help as well with coding issues

